      "mergedPostDetails": "(Reposted from the Dev Updates to here)\nIs there a way to fix the Drone Cam while sitting? At points when I’m sitting on something and use the drone cam then use it to fly and position it I will still accidentally move to the point where me and the drone cam are moving at the same time. There’s no issues while standing my body gets locked in place while using the drone, but when sitting or laying (No Full Body tracking just clicking to either sit or lay down on a furniture) I don’t know if anyone else has notice the problem but I use the camera a lot for recording/pictures.",
