  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-17T16:43:01.084Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nIf you are sitting in a station while using the desktop camera and are pressing `Mouse Wheel` to move the lens around, you will be kicked out of the station and start walking around.\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Go into a station (e.g. a chair)\n2. Open your Desktop Camera\n3. Press `Mouse Wheel` to move the camera lens\n4. Press `W` to move forward\nIf you do this you will notice that you will leave the station and are going to move around the in the world while at the same time also moving the drone camera.\n# Attachments: \nHere is a video of me showcasing the issue: https://streamable.com/aznris",
